{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-23T17:30:58.424Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"60599486030a4e9d3ed7788f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-23T17:30:58.422Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Blocking EOF review fixed in the shared import parsers, rather than a separate schema parser. Both full-buffer and streaming parsers now track whether a record has started independently of decoded field contents. A final quoted empty field is emitted even without a newline; LF/CRLF terminators reset the flag and do not invent another record. readTable validates this same parsed record stream and rejects the ragged/empty final row before any import write. Four added regressions cover quoted empty EOF, quoted empty plus newline, an unquoted blank final line, normal terminating LF/CRLF controls, native schema commands, every streaming chunk split and repeated end calls. PATH excludes git; complete tracker fingerprints remain unchanged. Targeted EOF tests: 4 passed; linked pm test: 4 passed; parser-focused run: 29 passed, 0 failed. Revert proof: replacing only parseCSV with its prior implementation caused 3 failures (missing final record and missing expected SDK/native-command refusals); replacing only StreamingCSVParser caused its chunk-split regression to fail. Both were restored; all 29 targeted parser/schema tests then passed. Tests import TypeScript source directly. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run docstring and npm run duplicates pass. Fresh final-head npm/Bun CI receipts will be recorded in PR 186."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-23T17:30:58.424Z"}],"before_hash":"20c0011b65ec46360d7c9b2ae7a20c84cc850d4b12a0d9319bc4dd5c67d305fb","after_hash":"97aa947d6b404ca130f6005a5eb69c98fbdf156c445c91cf959edcf37b67bcc5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"436d60f6698de3658a7a5ca978cff7994322dd93316af8ebad5c1c434a4c278b"}
